  "section_title": "Tooheys Top 10 Shootout Results - 1995",
  "section_text": "The Tooheys Top 10 Shootout determined the top grid positions for the 1995 Tooheys 1000. Drivers qualified individually under pressure, with lap times influencing starting position. Tony Longhurst, who placed 10th in the shootout, was born in Surfers Paradise.",
  "uid": "1995_Tooheys_1000_Top10_0",
  "intro": "The 1995 Tooheys 1000 was a legendary Australian touring car race held at Mount Panorama Circuit. As part of the qualifying process, the Tooheys Top 10 Shootout placed drivers into final starting order based on single timed laps. Below is a selection of drivers and their performance in the shootout, including their birthplaces."
